{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/store_image_title_01_eng.png?t=1753349491\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/Gig1.gif?t=1753349491\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run on walls, catch up with opponents and deal with them like a real ninja: using katanas, kunai, hammers, and anything that comes to hand \u2014 even a frying pan. Did you fail and get dealt with? Immediately return to the game and punish the offender, no boring waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/store_image_title_02_eng.png?t=1753349491\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1753349491\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remain the only one among 12 contenders for the title of the best ninja. Complete challenges in various modes one by one<strong> </strong>\u2014 try ninja party royale experience. As each stage progresses, opponents are out, and in the end, there is only one winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/store_image_title_03_eng.png?t=1753349491\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1753349491\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with a friend and lead your small ninja clan to victory. Cover your friend's back and become the best ninjas together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/store_image_title_04_eng.png?t=1753349491\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1753349491\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just play and replenish your collection of skins and upgrade those you liked the most \u2014 improve their appearance by reaching new levels. Build your ninja collection!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3186180?t=1753349491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753349491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/899084c71730152d8c8985b27ad299b1bf042ad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753349491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/899084c71730152d8c8985b27ad299b1bf042ad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753349491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/store_image_title_01_eng.png?t=1753349491\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\